  * scanline.
  *
+ * The music is notation, not sound: the four cues carry `%%MIDI program` so
+ * the host plays them on the Mac's General MIDI synth, and the fourteen
+ * species motifs carry `[I:chip ...]` so they go to its three-chip
+ * synthesiser. This program sends a few hundred bytes of ABC and never a
+ * sample. Two rules keep the motifs sparse, and both are the original's: one
+ * every thirty seconds, and when the thirty seconds are up the diver is
+ * chosen from the species you have heard LEAST recently -- which is why
+ * fourteen motifs are worth writing at all.
+ *
  * Left and right steer, space fires (one shot a press), escape quits.
  */
 
 
