+ *
+ * The four cues carry `%%MIDI program`, so they were written for a
+ * synthesiser and the host plays them on the Mac's General MIDI one. The
+ * fourteen motifs carry `[I:chip ...]`, so they go to the three-chip
+ * synthesiser. Nothing here chooses -- the notation says which machine it is
+ * for, and BChipPlayer sends the text either way.
