+ * The cues and motifs are VERBATIM from the Mojo GalaxigansDeluxe, which
+ * transcribed them from the assembler original's galaxigans_music.was.
+ * Generated from tunes.mojo and motifs.mojo; do not hand-edit.
+ *
+ * The sound effects are not from the original -- it had none written as
+ * notation -- and are short chip figures of our own, on chip 2 so that
+ * shooting never takes a voice the music is using.
+ */
